t deserve  goodness thrown their way and bucky is  one of them  hawkeye turned out to be one incredible  ride and introduced one of the most fun  and exciting mcu characters of the last  few years hayley steinfeld absolutely  nailed the role of kate bishop a stellar  archer who was inspired by clint barton  when she saw him defending new york from  the chitauri in 2012. her constant  fangirling over clint was perfectly  ironic given how there has always been a  debate amongst mcu fans whether hawkeye  might be the worst avenger kate is a  wonderfully naive character who is still  learning who she is and what are places  in the superhero world this type of  young hero is exactly what the mcu needs  moving forward and taking her out too  soon would be a big hit for the fanbase  there's also much to discover between  kate and elena bulova and fans are  certainly shipping that potential  friendship whose roots were laid in  hawkeye these two have the potential to  be the mcu's next besties so they must  be protected at all costs check out one  of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about the mcu  are coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

